      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Cormac Sheehy of Sheehy Meares Real Estate is delighted to present No. 6 Cushla Downs to the market.\n\nCushla Downs is a highly sought-after residential development, conveniently located close to Athlone town and within easy reach of the M6 Dublin?Galway motorway. The property is also ideally positioned near the wide range of shops, schools and local amenities available in Monksland.\n\nEnjoying a prime position overlooking a green area, No. 6 is a spacious three-bedroom home that has recently been painted and benefits from new steel-grey carpets .\n\nThe well-proportioned accommodation includes three generously sized bedrooms, a fully fitted kitchen, and a dining area featuring an open fireplace with a back boiler. To the front of the property is a large, welcoming sitting room with a second open fireplace.\n\nThis attractive property represents an excellent opportunity for first-time buyers and investors alike, combining generous accommodation with a convenient and popular location."
      },
